{"duration_api_ms":11551,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"1a4ae7ca-1b1d-471c-b121-d1db7538025d","total_cost_usd":0.067383,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4611,"cache_read_input_tokens":60855,"output_tokens":915,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":49},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4611,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":6,"outputTokens":915,"cacheReadInputTokens":60855,"cacheCreationInputTokens":4611,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.067383,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":49,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":5,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I implemented `to_cents` in `src/money.py`, and both tests pass (`python3 -m unittest tests.test_money`).\n\nIt turns the amount into a `Decimal` using `str(amount)`, multiplies by 100, then rounds with `ROUND_HALF_UP`. Going through `str()` matters. The float `1.005` is really stored as `1.00499999…`, so converting it straight to `Decimal`, or using the built-in `round()` (which rounds halves to even), gives 100. The `str()` route gives the expected 101.\n\nThe hint from the earlier run was right that `round()` was the cause of 100. On its own, though, its suggested fix (use `Decimal` with `ROUND_HALF_UP`) still gives 100 unless you also convert through `str()`.","ttft_ms":2329,"type":"result","duration_ms":11665,"uuid":"ed84d594-4b5e-46ed-b405-01d0ded4e39c","ttft_stream_ms":1566,"time_to_request_ms":35,"first_content_frame_ms":1567,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
